1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:02,800
Every building has a story.

2
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,900
A place where people live, work, connect, and build their lives.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:09,550
Meet BENA.

4
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:15,500
A connected building ecosystem, designed to bring buildings, people, and services together.

5
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:20,500
At its core, BENA gives every building a digital identity,

6
00:00:20,850 --> 00:00:25,850
