7
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:29,450
Designed to connect with municipal building information,

8
00:00:29,700 --> 00:00:34,600
BENA creates a foundation for a more organized and connected urban environment.

9
00:00:35,100 --> 00:00:41,550
Owners, residents, committees, and property managers can each access the experience that matters to them,

10
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:44,000
