13
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:57,100
Need a service? Looking for a property?

14
00:00:57,400 --> 00:01:03,800
BENA creates a connected ecosystem, where services and property opportunities become easier to discover.

15
00:01:04,500 --> 00:01:09,450
More than an application, BENA is a vision for a connected built environment,

16
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:13,600
where information, people, and services work better together.

17
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:16,850
Starting with the identity of each building,

18
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:22,300
BENA opens the door to a smarter, more connected future, for the places we share.

19
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,500
BENA.

20
